# Database migrations

Full reference: [`.agents/rules/database-migrations.md`](../../.agents/rules/database-migrations.md).

- Add the next numbered SQL file in both `packages/core/migrations/sqlite` and `packages/core/migrations/postgres`.
- Core applies the dialect that matches `DATABASE_URL` on startup.
- Empty `DATABASE_URL` creates `/data/otterscale.db`. `postgres://` uses Postgres. `file:` and `sqlite:` open that file.
